  "Notes": [
    {
      "Text": "Security update for gawk",
      "Title": "Topic",
      "Type": "Summary"
    },
    {
      "Text": "This update for gawk fixes the following issues:\n\n- CVE-2026-40467: use-after-free in the `io.c` program file via the `do_getline_redir()` routine (bsc#1271351).\n- CVE-2026-40468: integer overflow in the `builtin.c` program file (bsc#1271352).\n- CVE-2026-40553: buffer overflow in the `extension/readdir.c` program file via the `ftype()` routine (bsc#1271354).\n",
      "Title": "Details",
      "Type": "General"
    },
